<!doctype html><html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="csrf-token" content="{{ csrf_token() }}"><title>Pato na Pista — salas</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#fffaf0;color:#10283d;font:16px system-ui}header{background:#10283d;color:#fff;padding:16px 5vw;font-weight:900}main{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:48px 24px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,82px);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:10px 0}.hero p{font-size:18px;color:#60747b}.panel{background:#fff;border:2px solid #10283d;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:6px 6px #10283d;padding:22px;margin-top:24px}.room{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;border-bottom:1px solid #dce6e8;padding:14px 0}.room:last-child{border-bottom:0}.room strong{font-size:20px}.muted{color:#657880;font-size:14px}button,a.button{display:inline-block;border:2px solid #10283d;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 18px;background:#ffd45c;color:#10283d;font:inherit;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}</style></head><body><header>PATO NA PISTA 🦆</header><main><div class="hero"><div>🏁 ORGANIZADOR</div><h1>Suas salas de corrida.</h1><p>Crie uma nova sala ou continue uma corrida aberta. O QR code permanece válido até o sorteio começar.</p><button id="create">Criar nova sala</button></div><section class="panel"><h2>Histórico neste navegador</h2><div id="history"><p class="muted">Carregando salas...</p></div></section></main><script>const historyEl=document.getElementById('history'),key='duck-race-history';function render(){const rooms=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key)||'[]');historyEl.innerHTML=rooms.length?rooms.map(r=>`<div class="room"><div><strong>Sala ${r.code}</strong><div class="muted">Criada em ${new Date(r.created).toLocaleString('pt-BR')}</div></div><a class="button" href="/races/${r.code}">Abrir sala</a></div>`).join(''):'<p class="muted">Nenhuma sala criada ainda.</p>'}document.getElementById('create').onclick=async()=>{const r=await(await fetch('/api/races',{method:'POST'})).json();const rooms=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key)||'[]').filter(x=>x.code!==r.code);rooms.unshift({code:r.code,created:Date.now()});localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(rooms.slice(0,20)));location.href='/races/'+r.code};render()</script></body></html>
